---
description: Use Invictum Browser Bridge whenever the user requests IBB, IBG, Invictum Browser Bridge, or Invictum Browser Gate
alwaysApply: true
---

`IBB`, `IBG`, `Invictum Browser Bridge`, and `Invictum Browser Gate` are aliases
for the same local browser-control system.

When the user asks to use one of those names, read `AGENT_TRIGGER.md` from this
repository root and use the `invictum_*` MCP tools. Do not silently substitute
another browser automation surface. If MCP is unavailable, use the documented
CLI fallback.
